  "sentence_placements": [
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-01",
      "text": "The preparation role did what an old brief told it to do: 'Summarize the best session option.'",
      "source_start": 0.256,
      "source_end": 5.504,
      "sequence_start": 9.876,
      "sequence_end": 15.123999999999999
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-01",
      "text": "That sentence left the hardest part in Morgan's head.",
      "source_start": 5.803,
      "source_end": 8.491,
      "sequence_start": 15.422999999999998,
      "sequence_end": 18.110999999999997
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-01",
      "text": "What counts as ready?",
      "source_start": 8.789,
      "source_end": 9.899,
      "sequence_start": 18.409,
      "sequence_end": 19.519
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-01",
      "text": "Which source is required?",
      "source_start": 10.155,
      "source_end": 11.456,
      "sequence_start": 19.775,
      "sequence_end": 21.076
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-01",
      "text": "When must the work stop?",
      "source_start": 11.733,
      "source_end": 13.025,
      "sequence_start": 21.353,
      "sequence_end": 22.645
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-01",
      "text": "A human colleague might ask.",
      "source_start": 13.25,
      "source_end": 14.828,
      "sequence_start": 22.869999999999997,
      "sequence_end": 24.448
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-01",
      "text": "A paper agent design needs those answers written down.",
      "source_start": 14.999,
      "source_end": 18.05,
      "sequence_start": 24.619,
      "sequence_end": 27.67
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-02",
      "text": "Chapter Eleven turns the request into an Agentic PRD Packet.",
      "source_start": 18.37,
      "source_end": 22.264,
      "sequence_start": 27.990000000000002,
      "sequence_end": 31.884
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-02",
      "text": "Seven fields carry the load: outcome, scope fences, input manifest, acceptance tests, escalation, owner, and reversal.",
      "source_start": 22.532,
      "source_end": 31.471,
      "sequence_start": 32.152,
      "sequence_end": 41.091
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-02",
      "text": "The outcome is a comparison Morgan can review, not a session announcement.",
      "source_start": 31.748,
      "source_end": 35.77,
      "sequence_start": 41.368,
      "sequence_end": 45.39
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-02",
      "text": "Scope fences keep the role away from participant messages and calendar changes.",
      "source_start": 35.994,
      "source_end": 40.239,
      "sequence_start": 45.614,
      "sequence_end": 49.858999999999995
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-02",
      "text": "The input manifest lists the three Harbor note references and their freshness checks.",
      "source_start": 40.559,
      "source_end": 45.208,
      "sequence_start": 50.178999999999995,
      "sequence_end": 54.827999999999996
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-02",
      "text": "An acceptance test says staffing language must match the facilitator note exactly in meaning.",
      "source_start": 45.506,
      "source_end": 51.18,
      "sequence_start": 55.126,
      "sequence_end": 60.8
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-02",
      "text": "If the note is missing or ambiguous, the escalation is a hold for Morgan.",
      "source_start": 51.394,
      "source_end": 55.596,
      "sequence_start": 61.013999999999996,
      "sequence_end": 65.216
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-03",
      "text": "Reversal is modest here.",
      "source_start": 55.874,
      "source_end": 57.505,
      "sequence_start": 65.494,
      "sequence_end": 67.125
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-03",
      "text": "Morgan can return a draft for correction or withdraw it from review.",
      "source_start": 57.771,
      "source_end": 61.483,
      "sequence_start": 67.391,
      "sequence_end": 71.103
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-03",
      "text": "There is no external send to reverse.",
      "source_start": 61.867,
      "source_end": 64.043,
      "sequence_start": 71.487,
      "sequence_end": 73.66300000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-03",
      "text": "A test result belongs beside the draft as evidence: source IDs checked, staffing wording checked, review gate present.",
      "source_start": 64.341,
      "source_end": 71.989,
      "sequence_start": 73.961,
      "sequence_end": 81.60900000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-03",
      "text": "A failed check does not become a footnote under a confident recommendation.",
      "source_start": 72.297,
      "source_end": 76.137,
      "sequence_start": 81.917,
      "sequence_end": 85.757
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-03",
      "text": "It blocks the handoff.",
      "source_start": 76.393,
      "source_end": 77.822,
      "sequence_start": 86.013,
      "sequence_end": 87.44200000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-03",
      "text": "This packet remains a proposed design; writing it does not configure an agent.",
      "source_start": 78.142,
      "source_end": 82.708,
      "sequence_start": 87.762,
      "sequence_end": 92.328
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-04",
      "text": "Now give the work an organization.",
      "source_start": 83.049,
      "source_end": 84.721,
      "sequence_start": 92.66900000000001,
      "sequence_end": 94.34100000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-04",
      "text": "One role checks sources; one role assembles the comparison; Morgan owns the outcome.",
      "source_start": 85.07,
      "source_end": 90.061,
      "sequence_start": 94.69,
      "sequence_end": 99.68100000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-04",
      "text": "If both preparation roles produce separate answers without a common handoff, Morgan gets a small swarm and two versions of the truth.",
      "source_start": 90.232,
      "source_end": 97.836,
      "sequence_start": 99.852,
      "sequence_end": 107.456
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-04",
      "text": "Chapter Twelve's Pod Model asks for a charter, lead, specialists, board, standup, and handoff.",
      "source_start": 98.101,
      "source_end": 104.501,
      "sequence_start": 107.721,
      "sequence_end": 114.12100000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-04",
      "text": "For this tiny classroom pod, keep the lead as a preparation coordinator, not an approver.",
      "source_start": 104.885,
      "source_end": 110.133,
      "sequence_start": 114.50500000000001,
      "sequence_end": 119.753
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-04",
      "text": "The board is a proposed paper status list.",
      "source_start": 110.474,
      "source_end": 113.171,
      "sequence_start": 120.09400000000001,
      "sequence_end": 122.79100000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-04",
      "text": "The standup is a short proposed summary of ready and blocked work.",
      "source_start": 113.563,
      "source_end": 117.168,
      "sequence_start": 123.183,
      "sequence_end": 126.78800000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-05",
      "text": "The charter is narrow: prepare one evidence-bound option brief for Morgan.",
      "source_start": 117.488,
      "source_end": 121.67,
      "sequence_start": 127.108,
      "sequence_end": 131.29
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-05",
      "text": "The source checker may flag staleness, not repair a source by inventing a newer date.",
      "source_start": 122.011,
      "source_end": 126.694,
      "sequence_start": 131.631,
      "sequence_end": 136.314
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-05",
      "text": "The drafter may compare, not confirm staffing.",
      "source_start": 126.981,
      "source_end": 129.904,
      "sequence_start": 136.601,
      "sequence_end": 139.524
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-05",
      "text": "The coordinator may route a blocked packet to Morgan, not override the block.",
      "source_start": 130.267,
      "source_end": 134.277,
      "sequence_start": 139.887,
      "sequence_end": 143.897
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-05",
      "text": "The board should show who holds the next move.",
      "source_start": 134.576,
      "source_end": 136.956,
      "sequence_start": 144.196,
      "sequence_end": 146.576
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-05",
      "text": "If nobody owns a failed source check, the org chart is decorative.",
      "source_start": 137.288,
      "source_end": 141.043,
      "sequence_start": 146.90800000000002,
      "sequence_end": 150.663
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-05",
      "text": "Write that ownership into the handoff now.",
      "source_start": 141.342,
      "source_end": 143.582,
      "sequence_start": 150.96200000000002,
      "sequence_end": 153.202
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-06",
      "text": "Pause.",
      "source_start": 143.859,
      "source_end": 144.328,
      "sequence_start": 153.479,
      "sequence_end": 153.948
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-06",
      "text": "Who would receive the brief if the facilitator note stays unconfirmed?",
      "source_start": 144.542,
      "source_end": 148.275,
      "sequence_start": 154.162,
      "sequence_end": 157.895
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-06",
      "text": "Name the role and the human.",
      "source_start": 148.595,
      "source_end": 150.188,
      "sequence_start": 158.215,
      "sequence_end": 159.808
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-07",
      "text": "Draft the seven-field PRD in under a page.",
      "source_start": 150.458,
      "source_end": 153.21,
      "sequence_start": 160.078,
      "sequence_end": 162.83
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-07",
      "text": "Give it two acceptance tests, including the staffing claim, and one explicit failure route.",
      "source_start": 153.572,
      "source_end": 158.906,
      "sequence_start": 163.192,
      "sequence_end": 168.526
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-07",
      "text": "Then sketch the Pod Model: charter, lead, specialists, board, standup, handoff, and human owner.",
      "source_start": 159.119,
      "source_end": 166.653,
      "sequence_start": 168.739,
      "sequence_end": 176.273
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-07",
      "text": "Use role labels and course references.",
      "source_start": 166.891,
      "source_end": 168.917,
      "sequence_start": 176.511,
      "sequence_end": 178.537
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-07",
      "text": "Use a fictional or approved example.",
      "source_start": 169.195,
      "source_end": 171.285,
      "sequence_start": 178.815,
      "sequence_end": 180.905
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-07",
      "text": "Do not use private operational data, configure production agents, or promote the pod's coordinator into final decision authority.",
      "source_start": 171.541,
      "source_end": 178.762,
      "sequence_start": 181.161,
      "sequence_end": 188.382
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-08",
      "text": "Save revision seven as a draft.",
      "source_start": 179.028,
      "source_end": 181.311,
      "sequence_start": 233.64800000000002,
      "sequence_end": 235.93100000000004
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L07-08",
      "text": "A requirement becomes useful when a new teammate can tell what to prepare and when to stop.",
      "source_start": 181.588,
      "source_end": 187.33750566893423,
      "sequence_start": 236.20799999999997,
      "sequence_end": 241.95750566893423
    }
  ],
